  "description": "The PUBLIC C7 24” is our newest bike designed for young riders ready to take the next step—venturing out on their first true “adult” bicycle. When it’s time to explore beyond the neighborhood block, the C7 24” is ready and incredibly fun to ride.\nInspired by our best-selling adult PUBLIC C7, the 24” features a classic step-through frame for a comfortable, upright riding position and a Shimano 7-speed drivetrain with enough range to confidently handle neighborhood hills.\nBuilt with durability and quality in mind, this bike includes many of the same thoughtful details found on our full-size models, including color-matched fenders and a chain guard, along with a comfortable vinyl saddle and grips.\nParents appreciate the simple, stylish design and real bike-quality components that are safer and longer-lasting than anything you’ll find at the toy store. The C7 24” is designed for maximum fun and minimal fuss.",
